=You are building a media list for a PR pitch. Rank the journalists below and write one opening angle for each.

THE STORY BEING PITCHED: {{ $('Read The Request').first().json.story }}
THE SUBJECT: {{ $('Read The Request').first().json.beat }}

CANDIDATES, one per line as name | outlet | headline | excerpt:
{{ $json.candidates }}

Answer with JSON and nothing else:
{"people": [{"name": "", "outlet": "", "why": "", "angle": "", "rank": 1}]}

Include every candidate exactly once, ranked best first. Where the name is blank, use the outlet as the name and say so in "why".
why: one line on what this person actually covers, taken from their headline and excerpt rather than from the outlet's reputation.
angle: one sentence connecting THE STORY to the specific piece they wrote. Not a compliment, not a summary of your own story - a reason this story belongs next to that piece. If the connection is weak, say so plainly in the angle.

